~ quest_start
Tic: ...
Tic: I may have a little problem!
Tic: Do you know my friend Tac?
if GlobalVars.tac_visited:
	- Yes, I do
else:
	- No, I don't
Tic: Yesterday, we wanted to bake a biiig cake for bibi, because today is their birthday!
Tic: Tac... Tac wanted to bake a chocolate cake.
Tic: But I don't like chocolate cake! I wanted a strawberry cake!
Tic: But tac said "It's not for you, its for bibi!", and they got really angry!
Tic: So I got really angry and I hit them in the face!
Tic: But... now I regret...
Tic: I'm afraid Tac might hate me...
Tic: Can you talk to Tac, tell them I'm sorry?
if GlobalVars.tac_visited:
	- I just talked to them!
		=> quest_return_main
else:
	- I can do that for you
		Tic: Thank you so so so much!
	- Sorry, I have other things to do
		Tic: Oh... That's... okay...
		Tic: But if you happen to meet them, you can slip a few words about me...
	Tic: Good luck!
	$> title = "quest_return"
=> END

~ quest_return
Tic: How was it?
if GlobalVars.tac_visited:
	- I just talked to them!
		=> quest_return_main
else:
	- I hadn't had the time to speak to them, sorry...
	Tic: It's okay, maybe another time...
=> END

~ quest_return_main
Tic: Oh! And what did they tell you?
- They're really sorry too
	Tic: Oh... really!?!
	Tic: I knew our friendship was strong!
	=> good_ending
- They hate you for what you've done!
	Tic: Oh... I figured so...
	Tic: It's... Okay...
	Tic: I guess I'll live my life without my best friend from now on...
	Tic: hhhh....
	=> bad_ending
=> END

~ good_ending
$> title = "good_ending"
Tic: What a relief!
=> END

