~ bad_ending
$> title = "bad_ending"
Tic: [wave amp=30 freq=1] I'm soo saaaad!
Tic: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Do you have a tissue for me to cry in?
- Here you go
	Tic: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Thank youuuuu
	Tic: [wave amp=20 freq=1] *sobs*
- No, sorry
	Tic: [wave amp=30 freq=1] ...I understand...
	Tic: [wave amp=30 freq=1] I am not worthy of a piece of tissue
	Tic: [wave amp=50 freq=2] Tac was right to hate me!
=> END

